WEBVTT

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.760
Need the toothpicks?

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:00.760
Thanks.

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:04.170
See you later.

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:44.670
<i>I started first grade this spring.</i>

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:49.110
<i>There are five students at our branch school.</i>

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:10.460
<i>I guess this really is the country.</i>

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:13.890
<i>But we still have fun every day.</i>

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:36.980
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:48.010
<b>Episode 1</b>

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:48.010
<b>I Played the Frog Song</b>

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:51.710
Morning, Renge-chan.

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:53.980
You're earlier than usual today.

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:01.700
Konomi-nee, what's that?

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:03.660
A flute.

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:05.400
Flute?

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:09.280
It's a musical instrument. Like a recorder, 
but you hold it horizontally.

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:11.860
Do you play it for one of 
your high school classes?

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:15.660
No, I'm in the school concert band.

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:19.660
We play all kinds of different 
instruments there.

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:22.480
I have music class today,

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:26.220
but I can't get "do" to come out right.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:30.200
Want to practice together 
at my house next time?

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.690
Are you going anywhere over the long weekend?

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:49.720
Just shopping with my parents. Mama—

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:52.630
I mean, my mother has 
something she wants to buy.

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:55.370
Nee-chan, I wanna go shopping, too.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:59.070
Didn't Mom tell you to clean your room first?

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:03.410
Ren-chon, you're here early.

00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:04.740
You're practicing?

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:08.500
I want to be able to play 
this song right for someone.

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:10.020
Who?

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:11.320
It's a secret.

00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:14.030
And I'm gonna practice with Konomi-nee soon.

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:17.270
Oh, right. Konomi-chan plays 
the flute at her high school.

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:20.980
Morning, everyone.

