00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:34.700
Study
Period

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:58.470
Ren-chon, you've improved a lot, 
but that one note's a bit squeaky.

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:02.270
We'll be playing this same song 
next time we have music class.

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:03.470
Keep working at it.

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:04.430
Okay.

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:13.470
I'm starving!

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:23.700
Give me a bite of yours.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:26.670
On Duty
Hotarun | Koma-chan

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:30.760
Nee-chan, aren't you done 
with class duty stuff yet?

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:34.500
Don't rush with me. I only just got started.

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:37.720
Well, I'm bored. Get it done faster.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:39.440
Get up and help, then.

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:41.170
<i>I'm</i> not on duty.

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:46.200
Ren-chon, what're the toothpicks for?

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:49.040
I brought them so I could make a doll.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:50.950
A doll? How?

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:52.410
First...

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:56.660
You wrap clear tape around 
them to make them thicker.

00:07:56.920 --> 00:08:00.660
That's how you make the arms and legs.

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:04.630
Then you put them together 
in the shape you want, and...

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:07.830
It's done! The doll is done!

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:11.560
Huh, that's a pretty easy way to make a doll.

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:13.370
Maybe I'll try making one.

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:17.090
We can play with these until they're 
done with their class duties.

