How Objects Burn

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:23.520
Are you
done yet?

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.110
Hey, what's that? A doll?

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:28.300
I made it out of tape.

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:30.970
I made the speech bubble out of tape, too.

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:32.720
Wow, that's pretty cool.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:36.040
Make one with us when you're done working.

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:37.700
Sure, I'd love to.

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:46.360
Hey, hey, Nee-chan! Aren't you done yet?

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:48.220
Quite taking so long!

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:51.040
Get it done already and 
come play dolls with us!

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:00.380
That's not right!

00:09:00.380 --> 00:09:03.130
I did the same thing Ren-chon did, 
but the reaction was totally different!

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:05.130
And you ripped off its torso! That's harsh!

00:09:05.130 --> 00:09:07.410
Nattsun! I've got an extra torso!

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:08.990
Fix it with this!

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:11.730
Way to go, Ren-chon! You're always prepared!

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:31.270
All right! It looks even 
more like a dachshund now.

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:33.390
It's... not a bear?

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:35.180
Whatever.

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:38.050
Hotaru, were you filling out the class log?

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:41.510
Yes, but I'm not quite done yet.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.440
What do you have left?

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:46.920
Well, I'm done with the 
class records and stuff,

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:49.430
but I still have the part about my 
thoughts and ideas for improvement.

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:52.410
Then let's wrap that up 
quick and be done with it.

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:56.150
Yeah. Was there anything about today 
that you think could be improved?

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:59.920
Hmm... Natsumi was annoying 
during music class.

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:03.560
Also, she ate three servings 
of curry during lunch,

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:07.110
and she was off playing around 
during the study period... and...

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:07.880
I object, dachs!

00:10:08.510 --> 00:10:11.440
Kazu-nee was sleeping during 
the study period, dachs.

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:15.100
I don't think Natsumi-chan 
should shoulder all the blame, dachs.

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:18.010
So don't write about Natsumi-chan, dachs.

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.970
Write about Kazu-nee, dachs!

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:23.650
U-Um, Komari-senpai, what do I do now?

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:27.350
It's fine. Don't worry about it. 
Just make it all about Natsumi.

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.660
Don't, dachs! Don't, dachs!

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:33.360
When you write about me all the 
time, Mom hears about it, dachs!

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:36.690
Oh, all right, fine! You can give it a rest!

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:39.550
We'll write about Kazu-nee, 
so just shut up already!

00:10:39.550 --> 00:10:43.380
Also, just making its torso longer 
doesn't make it look like a dachshund.

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:44.620
'Kay.

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:46.500
Let's play, Ren-chon.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:47.570
'Kay.

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:48.810
Sheesh...

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:51.550
Okay, for things that could've 
been improved today,

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:55.510
we'll say the teacher fell asleep 
and should be more careful.

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:56.540
Okay.

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:58.930
Oh, put Sensei down for coming in late, too.

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:01.640
Oh, this part isn't just for students?

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:04.200
As for thoughts about today...

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:07.320
I don't know... I can't think of anything.

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:10.140
I guess we can just put that 
Natsumi ate too much curry—

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:12.150
You're writing about me anyway?!

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:16.100
So you were lying when you said 
you wouldn't?! That's dirty!

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:18.240
I never said we weren't going to.

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:20.470
I just said we'd write about Kazu-nee.

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:22.120
You're such a pain!

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:23.730
Nattsun, calm down!

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:27.660
I made a new doll! We'll play with this one!

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:29.200
Don't stop me, Ren-chon!

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:30.700
I can't be calm about—

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:17.790
Okay, now that Natsumi's frozen, 
let's finish the class log.

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:19.350
R-Right...

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:24.640
<b>Faculty Room</b>

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:24.640
That took way too long since 
Natsumi kept butting in.

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:28.610
Well, all that's left is to take 
the class log to the faculty room.

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:31.430
What should we do when we get home?

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:33.660
We still have time before the bus comes,

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:35.560
so we can keep playing with dolls.

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:37.610
How long until it gets here?

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:39.030
An hour.

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:40.530
Excuse us.

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:43.500
Hey, Kazu-nee's sleeping again!

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:47.600
I told you, Nee-chan! 
Kazu-nee's the one who needs to improve!

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:50.460
I wondered why she wasn't 
coming to the classroom...

00:12:51.840 --> 00:12:54.950
We have time before the bus gets here, right?

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:56.300
So...

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:06.880
Oh, shoot! I fell asleep.

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:09.710
I need to finish organizing the print-outs...

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:16.480
Pathetic
Wake up

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:16.480
Maaaa

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:16.480
Stop
Sleeping

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:16.480
Awaken
Now

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:19.710
Whoa. So many creepy-faced dolls here.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:31.030
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:10.520
This isn't working. 
It's just not coming out right.

00:14:10.520 --> 00:14:14.180
And playing in front of people makes 
me nervous, which makes it even worse,

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:18.530
and when I practice with other kids, 
I'm too embarrassed to ask for help...

00:14:18.530 --> 00:14:23.750
Maybe someone who's so anxious with 
strangers isn't cut out for concert band.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:27.120
Wait, no! I need to practice more 
so I can play in front of—

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:30.020
Oh, someone's still here?

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:34.350
You're... the new member, 
Shinoda Akane-chan, right?

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:35.480
Uh, yes...

00:14:35.480 --> 00:14:37.800
I'm about to lock up the music room.

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:38.760
Oh, okay.

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:41.770
You were practicing on your 
own? That's impressive.

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:44.970
If you're having trouble with anything, 
feel free to ask for help, okay?

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:50.350
Then, um...

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:55.490
Since you offered...

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:02.800
I see. You're anxious around strangers,

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:06.620
so you get nervous in front of 
people and can't play well,

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:08.640
and you want to work on that?

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:09.420
Yeah...

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:12.460
Hmm... Yes, I see.

00:15:12.460 --> 00:15:15.430
Then why don't you come practice at my house?

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:16.280
Huh?

00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:19.970
The best way to get comfortable with 
strangers is to practice with someone, right?

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:21.630
Are you free this weekend?

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:24.150
Uh, y-yes...

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:27.500
Okay, then, get off at the station 
near my house this weekend.

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:29.560
I'll get someone to show 
you the way from there.

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:32.910
Huh? Show me the way? 
You're not coming yourself?

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:35.660
It'll be more practice to get over 
your anxiety with strangers.

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:38.940
So make friends with them when 
they bring you to my house, okay?

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:40.940
<i>With a stranger?</i>

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:44.320
<i>But I guess it is a good 
opportunity. I should go for it.</i>

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:58.010
Meowning.

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:05.020
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:08.490
Nice to meet you. My name's Renge.

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:12.160
Konomi-nee told me to take you to her house.

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:16.160
She said she'll help me practice 
with my recorder after I do.

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:20.340
So what's your name, anyway?

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:23.540
U-Uh... It's Akane.

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:26.140
Okay, got it. You're Aka-chan.

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:27.990
Aka-chan... means "baby"...

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:30.040
Okay, I'll show you the way now.

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:33.150
Uh, I'd prefer it if you called me Akane...

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:38.150
Are you Konomi-nee's friend, Akane-chan?

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:41.730
I-It's more like I'm her 
underclassman at school...

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:43.830
Oh, okay.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:50.110
<i>I don't even know what to 
talk to a little kid about...</i>

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:53.110
<i>This defeats the purpose of 
coming all the way... No, no!</i>

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:56.650
<i>I can't be like this! I have 
to try harder to talk to her!</i>

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:57.890
Hey!

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:00.480
Wh-What's the matter?

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:04.830
I found my lifelong enemy over here!

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:08.590
Cockleburs! They always 
get stuck to my clothes!

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:10.840
You won't have your way today!

00:17:11.220 --> 00:17:13.060
Prepare yourself!

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:14.480
Smack!

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:19.690
You can have this.

00:17:19.690 --> 00:17:21.850
Huh? Oh, uh, thanks...

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:25.820
<i>What am I supposed to do with this?</i>

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:32.750
Wh-What is it? Did you find something else?

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:34.070
A frog!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:37.270
A frog? Oh, yeah, frogs are cute, huh?

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:45.330
Want this toad?

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:47.660
N-No, I don't! Put it on the ground!

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:53.670
Okay, I'll put it down like this and 
pretend it can walk on two feet.

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:56.840
No, don't make it walk! Let it go!

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:59.170
His name is Fatty!

00:17:56.840 --> 00:18:04.220
<b>Cattle Crossing</b>

00:17:59.170 --> 00:18:00.830
It doesn't need a name!

00:18:00.830 --> 00:18:04.670
Whoa, whoa! Don't walk 
it this way! Stop! Stop!

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:09.200
So Renge-chan chased you 
around with a frog, huh?

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:10.580
Yeah...

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:13.390
Sounds like a crazy time.

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:16.800
She's just a kid, though. 
You should cut her some slack.

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:20.850
I washed my hands.

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:24.010
Here's the recorder you left with me.

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:25.170
Thanks.

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:32.480
That's not the same as my recorder!

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:35.360
What's it sound like? Play it for me!

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:37.300
Uh, o-okay...

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:51.770
Wow! It made a sound!

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:55.520
And it has so many buttons! 
It's so cool! Like an octopus tentacle!

00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:59.070
Couldn't you think of anything 
else to compare it to?

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:02.000
That octorecorder sure is cool, though.

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.970
I wanna play the octorecorder!

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:06.500
It's a flute, not an octorecorder.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:07.380
Huh?

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:11.450
You said you were anxious around strangers, 
but you're talking with Renge-chan just fine.

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:13.530
Y-You think so?

00:19:13.530 --> 00:19:18.320
Maybe having her chase you around with 
a frog actually loosened up your nerves.

00:19:18.810 --> 00:19:21.410
I'm gonna practice the "do" sound.

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:26.620
Oh, Renge-chan, to play "do,"

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:28.780
cover the hole with the pad of your finger.

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:32.770
And try blowing with a little less force.

00:19:41.540 --> 00:19:43.390
There you go! You got it!

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:44.960
That sounds perfect.

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:47.230
Why don't we all play something together?

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:49.740
Let's play the "Frog Song!"

00:19:49.740 --> 00:19:50.960
Is that okay?

00:19:51.510 --> 00:19:54.090
Sure. I know that one.

00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:55.250
Okay.

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:57.980
Ready... go!

00:20:30.110 --> 00:20:32.250
Thank you for all your help today.

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:33.500
Come by again sometime.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:34.240
Sure.

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:36.900
U-Um...

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:49.100
Could you... practice with me again sometime?

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:50.680
Of course!

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:53.150
I wanna practice with you, too!

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:57.440
Promise, okay?

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:02.390
Sure! Thanks for everything 
today, Renge-chan!

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:33.780
Yes!

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:39.360
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:39.360
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:45.840
You've gotten much better, Ren-chan.

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:49.160
But who was it that you 
wanted to play this for?

00:21:54.470 --> 00:21:59.650
I heard cows make more milk when 
you play classical music for them.

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:04.130
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:13.060
<b>That's all for today</b>

00:23:30.900 --> 00:23:35.090
Hey, why don't I introduce you 
to another neighbor of mine?

00:23:35.090 --> 00:23:37.320
I'll do my best to overcome 
my anxiety with strangers!

00:23:37.320 --> 00:23:40.100
Once the rain stops, 
how about we build a greenhouse?

00:23:40.100 --> 00:23:42.000
I'll lend you my lap for 
a pillow! As a big sister!

00:23:42.000 --> 00:23:44.230
Using your lap as a pillow 
is just too embarrassing!

00:23:44.230 --> 00:23:46.510
Ichijou-san, it's a pleasure to meet you!

00:23:46.530 --> 00:23:50.530
<b>Next Time
Episode 2</b>

